<title>USA: Sundstrand Corp Q4 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Sundstrand Corp Q4 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKFORD, Ill. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.71		    $0.61</p>
<p> Oper net		  43,000		   38,000</p>
<p> Revs		     411,000		  395,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  61,000		   62,700</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Operating earnings are before restructuring charges.</p>
<p>Q4 net including charges was $20.0 million or $0.32 a share vs $36.0 million or $0.57 a share.  </p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $2.30		    $1.96</p>
<p> Oper net		 140,000		  123,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,521,000		1,440,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  61,000		   62,700</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1995 revenues are from ongoing businesses and exclude $33.0 million in sales from divested units.</p>
<p>Full-year 1996 and 1995 operating profits are before restructuring charges.</p>
<p>After restructuring charges, year net was $114.0 million or $1.87 a share vs $79.0 million or $1.25 a share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
